---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Project | Agents in a Rendezvous" description="Project overview, milestones, and success criteria.">
  <section class="space-y-8">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold">Project Overview</h1>
    <div class="grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-2">
      <div class="card space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Problem statement</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-300">Today, many AI systems can describe orbital rendezvous but struggle to produce accurate, tool-ready solutions. That gap matters because the difference between a plausible answer and an operationally valid maneuver plan is critical in space analysis.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Solution approach</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-300">The site documents a workflow where agents solve a series of two-body rendezvous cases, check results against orbital propagation tools, and surface maneuver recommendations only when they are supported by the math.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">System flow</h2>
      <div class="mt-6 flex flex-col items-center gap-4 md:flex-row md:justify-between">
        <div class="flow-node pulse">Perceive</div>
        <div class="text-orbital">→</div>
        <div class="flow-node pulse">Detect</div>
        <div class="text-orbital">→</div>
        <div class="flow-node pulse">Replan</div>
        <div class="text-orbital">→</div>
        <div class="flow-node pulse">Validate</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-3">
      <div class="card"><h3 class="font-semibold">Milestone 1</h3><p class="text-slate-300">Define a benchmark set of two-body rendezvous problems.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><h3 class="font-semibold">Milestone 2</h3><p class="text-slate-300">Run baseline agent responses and capture failure modes.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><h3 class="font-semibold">Milestone 3</h3><p class="text-slate-300">Compare outputs against propagation and analytic tools.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><h3 class="font-semibold">Milestone 4</h3><p class="text-slate-300">Prototype maneuver translation into tool-ready formats.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><h3 class="font-semibold">Milestone 5</h3><p class="text-slate-300">Summarize results and recommendations for next steps.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><h3 class="font-semibold">Success metrics</h3><p class="text-slate-300">Accuracy, consistency, explainability, and tool compatibility.</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
